# lifeline
===
 Desktop resupply planner for disaster response and humanitarian logistics. Compares truck, drone and parachute airdrop delivery on real terrain, OpenStreetMap roads and wind forecasts, with line-of-sight risk, Sentinel-2 flood detection (U-Net, ONNX) and a schedule. Rust engine, Tauri app, CLI.
